SUBTOPIC 5 - MATHS OPERATIONS - ADD, SUB, MUL, DIV
----------------------------------------------------
Explain:
Numpy does maths on full array in 1 line, no loop. Element by element.

Where to use in Project?
Calculate new balance after interest, calculate total balance, calculate EMI.

Old vs New - Advantage:
Old - Loop for each user, slow.
New - 1 line for all users.

Example Code with Comment:
